Subject: [PATCH] Sweep: FileDialogCustomPlace(s), ImeContext,
 ThreadExceptionDialog

Additive types, signatures from the net48 reference:

- FileDialogCustomPlace (path or known-folder GUID) and
  FileDialogCustomPlacesCollection : Collection<FileDialogCustomPlace> with the
  Add(string)/Add(Guid) convenience overloads.
- ImeContext - static IME helper; IME state is managed by GTK, so the methods are
  safe no-ops / default queries (GetImeMode -> NoControl, IsOpen -> false).
- ThreadExceptionDialog : Form (ctor(Exception)) - the default unhandled-exception
  dialog, showing the exception type and message.

Full suite green at 2351 (+4 tests).

